<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83708" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλεονέκτ-ης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ πλέον ἔχων</span>
			, <i>one who has</i> or <i>claims more than his due, greedy,
				grasping,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.40
			</span></i>, etc.: as Adj.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος π.</span>
			<i>a greedy, arrogant</i> speech, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.158
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλεονεκτίστατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					1.2.12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν παντὶ πλεονέκτην τῶν πολεμίων</span>
			<i>making gain</i> from their losses, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.6.27
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> metaph. in
			Math., of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ὑπερτελές,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>in Nic.</u>
				p.32
			</span></i> P.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
